fclone
======

This project is based on the upstream rclone source code. Exact embedded-core
coordinates are recorded in each versioned release note.

rclone is Copyright (C) 2012-2026 The Rclone Authors and is distributed under
the MIT License. The complete license text is included in COPYING. The upstream
project is available at https://github.com/rclone/rclone.

The compatibility behavior in this project was informed by the historical
mawaya/rclone fclone work (https://github.com/mawaya/rclone) and donwa/gclone
(https://github.com/donwa/gclone). The current compatibility implementation was
rewritten against the current rclone codebase; this project is not a continuation or
official release of either historical fork.

